## 4. Database Schema (Mongoose Models)

### 4.1 Product Schema (`Product`)
- `title`: String (required, indexed)
- `slug`: String (required, unique, indexed)
- `sku`: String (optional, unique base SKU)
- `shortDescription`: String
- `description`: String (rich markdown/HTML)
- `category`: ObjectId (ref: 'Category', indexed)
- `images`: Array of `{ url: String, alt: String, isPrimary: Boolean }`
- `basePrice`: Number (required, BDT)
- `compareAtPrice`: Number (optional, for discount badge)
- `status`: Enum `['draft', 'published', 'archived']` (default: 'published')
- `hasVariants`: Boolean (default: false)
- `variants`: Array of:
  - `_id`: ObjectId
  - `sku`: String (required, indexed)
  - `name`: String (e.g. "Dusty Pink - Large")
  - `attributes`: Map of String (e.g. `{ color: "Dusty Pink", size: "Large" }`)
  - `price`: Number (overrides basePrice if set)
  - `stock`: Number (default: 0)
  - `image`: String
- `totalStock`: Number (aggregated for indexing/filtering)
- `salesCount`: Number (default: 0, for authentic Best Sellers ranking)
- `isFeatured`: Boolean (default: false)
- `seo`: `{ title: String, description: String, keywords: [String] }`
- `createdAt`, `updatedAt`: Timestamps

### 4.2 Category Schema (`Category`)
- `name`: String (required)
- `slug`: String (required, unique, indexed)
- `description`: String
- `image`: String
- `sortOrder`: Number (default: 0)
- `isActive`: Boolean (default: true)
- `timestamps`: true

### 4.3 Order Schema (`Order`)
- `orderNumber`: String (required, unique, indexed, e.g. `ISH-2610-8472`)
- `accessToken`: String (cryptographically secure random token for guest authorization)
- `customer`:
  - `name`: String (required)
  - `phone`: String (required, indexed)
  - `email`: String (optional)
  - `address`: String (required)
  - `deliveryZone`: String (required, e.g. "inside_dhaka" | "outside_dhaka")
  - `notes`: String
- `items`: Array of snapshot objects:
  - `productId`: ObjectId (ref: 'Product')
  - `variantId`: ObjectId (optional)
  - `title`: String
  - `variantName`: String
  - `sku`: String
  - `price`: Number
  - `quantity`: Number
  - `image`: String
  - `itemTotal`: Number
- `pricing`:
  - `subtotal`: Number
  - `deliveryFee`: Number
  - `discount`: Number
  - `total`: Number
- `paymentMethod`: String (default: 'COD')
- `paymentStatus`: Enum `['unpaid', 'paid', 'refunded']` (default: 'unpaid')
- `status`: Enum `['pending', 'confirmed', 'processing', 'shipped', 'delivered', 'cancelled', 'returned']` (default: 'pending')
- `courier`:
  - `provider`: String (e.g. 'Pathao', 'Steadfast', 'RedX', 'Manual')
  - `trackingCode`: String
  - `consignmentId`: String
  - `notes`: String
- `timeline`: Array of:
  - `status`: String
  - `timestamp`: Date
  - `note`: String
  - `actor`: String (e.g. 'Customer', 'Admin: Sarah')
- `marketing`:
  - `utmSource`: String
  - `utmMedium`: String
  - `utmCampaign`: String
- `timestamps`: true

### 4.4 Admin Schema (`Admin`)
- `username`: String (required, unique)
- `email`: String (required, unique)
- `passwordHash`: String (required)
- `name`: String
- `role`: Enum `['superadmin', 'manager']`
- `isActive`: Boolean (default: true)
- `lastLogin`: Date

### 4.5 StoreSettings Schema (`StoreSettings`)
- `storeName`: String (default: "Ishara")
- `tagline`: String
- `contactPhone`: String
- `contactEmail`: String
- `address`: String
- `deliveryZones`: Array of:
  - `code`: String (e.g. 'inside_dhaka')
  - `name`: String (e.g. "Inside Dhaka")
  - `fee`: Number (e.g. 70)
  - `estimatedDays`: String (e.g. "1-2 days")
- `metaPixelId`: String
- `freeShippingThreshold`: Number
- `codNotice`: String

