## 5. API Specification

| Endpoint | Method | Access | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `/api/products` | GET | Public | Paginated catalog with filters (category, price, search, sort) |
| `/api/products/[slug]` | GET | Public | Single product details with live variant stocks |
| `/api/categories` | GET | Public | Active category hierarchy |
| `/api/checkout/quote` | POST | Public | Authoritative server price, shipping fee & total calculation |
