| `/api/admin/orders` | GET | Admin | Paginated admin order list with status & date filters |
| `/api/admin/orders/[id]`| PATCH | Admin | Update status, courier tracking, and audit log |
| `/api/admin/stats` | GET | Admin | High-level analytics: revenue, order funnel, low stock |
| `/api/admin/settings` | GET / PUT | Admin | Manage shipping fees, contact details, pixel configs |

